Metadata-Version: 2.1
Name: pyRTC
Version: 1.0.0
Summary: An object-oriented adaptive optics real-time control software written in Python. The goal is to be a universal and simple to use python package while maintaining enough real-time performance to be widely applicable within the AO community.
